CHANGES IN VERSION 3.79.1
--------------------------

    o The deprecated `ggplot2::aes_string()` used in `meanSdPlot()` has been replaced with `ggplot2::aes()`.
    o The error message when `reference@mu` doesn't have the expected length in `vsnMatrix()` no longer says
    "too few arguments" and now reports the actual and expected lengths.

CHANGES IN VERSION 3.43.10
---------------------------

    o Vignette now is in HTML, using BiocStyle::html_document2
